{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "welcome",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Welcome to ThinkBoard\n\nThis is a **scratch board** \u2014 play with it freely. Nothing here is saved, and it comes back each time you launch without a board of your own.\n\nBoards are Obsidian `.canvas` files. ThinkBoard reads and writes them in place and keeps anything it doesn't use, so a board stays one Obsidian can open.",
			"x": -825,
			"y": -365,
			"width": 575,
			"height": 300
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_edit",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Double-click** any note to edit. Press **Esc** or **Cmd/Ctrl+Enter** when you're done.",
			"x": -12,
			"y": -498,
			"width": 389,
			"height": 61
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_connect",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Hover a note's edge to reveal a **dot**, then drag it onto another note to connect them.",
			"x": -10,
			"y": -375,
			"width": 392,
			"height": 61
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_ai",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Ask AI** turns a chain of notes into a prompt and writes the reply back onto the board.\n\nIt needs a provider first \u2014 **Settings \u2192 AI**, pick one and paste a key. Until then the menu item stays hidden.",
			"x": 12,
			"y": -256,
			"width": 361,
			"height": 134
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_settings",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Open **Settings** from the menu-bar icon \u2014 themes, fonts, AI, and how the board behaves.",
			"x": 26,
			"y": -98,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 110
		},
		{
			"id": "tip_summon",
			"type": "text",
